    "description": "The annual graduation ceremony for Fellows, Residents and Interns of The Aga Khan University's (AKU) Postgraduate Medical Education Programme will be held on Saturday, October 23, 1999. The President, College of Physicians and Surgeons, Pakistan, Professor M. Sultan Farooqui, will be the chief guest.",
